{
 "duration": 81.55,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "b01",
   "who": "nova",
   "text": "You shipped your app today. Two hundred views.",
   "s": 0.25,
   "e": 2.788
  },
  {
   "id": "b02",
   "who": "theo",
   "text": "But Theo's launch ad hit forty thousand by lunch.",
   "s": 3.108,
   "e": 6.168
  },
  {
   "id": "b03",
   "who": "nova",
   "text": "So you open his app. It does half of yours.",
   "s": 6.488,
   "e": 9.126
  },
  {
   "id": "b04",
   "who": "nova",
   "text": "Three months ago, you had a job and an idea.",
   "s": 9.446,
   "e": 12.484
  },
  {
   "id": "b05",
   "who": "nova",
   "text": "Every night after work, you coded until two.",
   "s": 12.804,
   "e": 15.154
  },
  {
   "id": "b06",
   "who": "nova",
   "text": "Until one night, you quit the job to ship it.",
   "s": 15.474,
   "e": 17.544
  },
  {
   "id": "b07",
   "who": "theo",
   "text": "But Theo just grins. Views are views, he says. Speed wins.",
   "s": 17.864,
   "e": 21.69
  },
  {
   "id": "b08",
   "who": "nova",
   "text": "So you think about an ad too.",
   "s": 22.01,
   "e": 23.56
  },
  {
   "id": "b09",
   "who": "blip",
   "text": "But Blip beeps. Problem one. A view is not a person.",
   "s": 23.88,
   "e": 27.466
  },
  {
   "id": "b10",
   "who": "blip",
   "text": "Instagram counts a view each time a reel starts. Replays too.",
   "s": 27.786,
   "e": 31.196
  },
  {
   "id": "b11",
   "who": "theo",
   "text": "So forty thousand views might be a few thousand people.",
   "s": 31.516,
   "e": 34.916
  },
  {
   "id": "b12",
   "who": "theo",
   "text": "But his ad has zero comments.",
   "s": 35.236,
   "e": 37.536
  },
  {
   "id": "b13",
   "who": "blip",
   "text": "So, problem two. Nobody shares a demo.",
   "s": 37.856,
   "e": 40.914
  },
  {
   "id": "b14",
   "who": "blip",
   "text": "Instagram's boss says sends beat likes for reaching new people.",
   "s": 41.234,
   "e": 45.462
  },
  {
   "id": "b15",
   "who": "blip",
   "text": "So people don't share apps. They share stories.",
   "s": 45.782,
   "e": 49.082
  },
  {
   "id": "b16",
   "who": "nova",
   "text": "So your story is the bug that almost killed it?",
   "s": 49.402,
   "e": 52.212
  },
  {
   "id": "b17",
   "who": "theo",
   "text": "But Theo says post a clean demo. Nobody cares about bugs.",
   "s": 52.532,
   "e": 56.05
  },
  {
   "id": "b18",
   "who": "nova",
   "text": "Three nights. One bug. You almost quit.",
   "s": 56.37,
   "e": 59.168
  },
  {
   "id": "b19",
   "who": "blip",
   "text": "So Blip is sure. Show the night you almost quit.",
   "s": 59.488,
   "e": 62.348
  },
  {
   "id": "b20",
   "who": "nova",
   "text": "But one new comment sits under your post. It's from Theo.",
   "s": 62.668,
   "e": 65.896
  },
  {
   "id": "b21",
   "who": "nova",
   "text": "The demo is safe. It looks pro. Nobody shares it.",
   "s": 66.216,
   "e": 69.822
  },
  {
   "id": "b22",
   "who": "nova",
   "text": "But the story is scary. Everyone sees you almost failed.",
   "s": 70.142,
   "e": 74.56
  },
  {
   "id": "b23",
   "who": "blip",
   "text": "So, one post tonight. Tomorrow, they count.",
   "s": 74.88,
   "e": 77.734
  },
  {
   "id": "b24",
   "who": "nova",
   "text": "Comment A for the demo, or B for the story.",
   "s": 78.054,
   "e": 81.23
  }
 ],
